current_boundary_crossover_mutation_browser_delta: Deterministic crossover and bounded mutation now have compact browser Model Provenance Operator proof: `crossover-operator-registry` and `mutation-operator-registry` render receipt-bound Operator rows, while `crossover-operator-receipt-drift` and `mutation-operator-receipt-drift` prove byte-echo fallback before registry entries become selectable.
